From 0fa60476def66163fb67b49a4d3aac15b91b668d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dimkaps <150019158+dimkaps@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Mar 2026 13:31:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Adds support for sensors behind an I2C Switch (#3)

Adds support for sensors behind an I2C switch on the CCI bus by selecting the appropriate switch channel before CCI read/write/poll operations.
-Extend camera_io_master with I2C switch address/channel fields and a mutex intended to serialize switch select + CCI transactions.
-Add cam_cci_i2c_write_switch() helper and call it from CCI read/write/read-seq/poll paths.
-Parse new DT properties (i2c-switch, i2c-channel) into io_master_info.
The cam_cci_i2c_write_switch changes the channel of the I2C switch before each communication with the sensor.
